{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the first 100 positive integers is 5050. That is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/4/6c469322be7f5681569e4c6597be5ad787c81494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + \\cdots + 99 + 100 = 5050$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"236\" height=\"15\" />. What is the sum of the first 100 positive odd integers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b5b72a162cb0999e9a5980d1539186ac3c1dbca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 5050 \\quad \\text{(B) } 10\\,000 \\quad \\text{(C) } 10\\,050 \\quad \\text{(D) } 10\\,100 \\quad \\text{(E) } 10\\,150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"451\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Re